      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-12T19:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not just use `r.URL.RequestURI()`? It encodes the special characters properly, and doesn\u0027t have the issue with the unmodified `r.RequestURI`.",
